    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "**AI finds patterns that repeat across its training data.**\n\nWhy would repeating patterns be useful for making something new?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/431ce5af7a0df86f3b1bf17c903cdbde-Lavender slab with green dots.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-935f641d-7a93-44e8-81ce-6ded8f68ea2e",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "For example, this training data includes many different cats.\n\nColors and markings vary, but some features repeat.\n\n**AI learns shared patterns, like pointed ears.**\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/25d4d40709b6999fdd996b2f4af4732a-Black Cat Silhouette Among Colorful Tiles.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-b1f698e8-6cee-47e4-9b38-59e7d8253e5b",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "AI uses your prompt and patterns it learned to make a new image.\n\n---\n\n**Something to think about:** Who chooses the training data, and what might be missing from it?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/1f43132bffedad336662e28ab8fd0e8a-Prompt plus learned patterns_ a new cat.png",
        "key": "adaptive-test-debug-panel-5b46df30-8529-4368-84d7-7e9d4c52c78c",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "use_links": "false"
  },
